{"candidateAnswer":"The dairy-free chocolate mousse, which got the most positive comments from viewers.","evidence":"[D21:6 | 1:43 pm on 14 September, 2022] Nate: Coconut milk ice cream is at the top of my list. It's so smooth and creamy with a tropical coconut twist. Plus, it's dairy-free for people who can't have lactose or who want vegan options. Here's a snap of the ice cream I made.","itemId":"urn:uuid:04ad3c96-b20c-5e63-a504-d36b18dcf40e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:01cc8d9e84549c433170da4b1a33636d7fd6277ae667e8b53ac9b4b5090b8a37","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Nate's favorite dish from the cooking show he hosted?","referenceAnswer":"Coconut milk ice cream","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"01cc8d9e84549c433170da4b1a33636d7fd6277ae667e8b53ac9b4b5090b8a37"}}]}